  "description": "Drop-in server telemetry for any .NET application. Reports CPU, memory, an optional live session count, and your own custom metrics to TestVibe: during a load test they render in the result next to the client-side numbers, and while the project Dashboard is open they render in its real-time \"Live servers\" section. Register once at startup with the TestVibe server URL and an API key — there is no idle traffic and telemetry is always best-effort.",
